  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9f1a15fd-6230-5734-a001-0c185e030e92" activityNameId="0b452f97-7073-5022-89cb-ac7ad0c92431" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Heat, natural gas, at diffusion absorption heat pump 4kW, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Heat, natural gas, at diffusion absorption heat pump 4kW, future
NOx and CO emissions derived from measurements of gas boilers operated with natural gas under controlled conditions;
Synonyms: DAHP, DAWP; 
UUID: 61442c88-f488-3dcf-af70-f7e58333136a
The module includes input natural gas input from low pressure gas network (CH), infrastructure (heat pump with peak boiler and borehole heat exchanger), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Biogas input modelled for conditions in Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Diffusion absorption heat pump with 4 kWth nominal thermal power connected to a short borehole heat exchanger. The unit includes a peak load boiler which allows a maximal output power of 11 kWth. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Seasonal performance factor (SPF) of 1.32. Supply temperature of the heating system 50°C.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information, emissions from ecoinvent process natural gas, burned in boiler condensing modulating under 100kW 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_61442c88-f488-3dcf-af70-f7e58333136a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Biogas input modelled for conditions in Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Diffusion absorption heat pump with 4 kWth nominal thermal power connected to a short borehole heat exchanger. The unit includes a peak load boiler which allows a maximal output power of 11 kWth. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Seasonal performance factor (SPF) of 1.32. Supply temperature of the heating system 50°C.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2000-01-01" endDate="2005-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
